"use strict";(self.webpackChunkhb=self.webpackChunkhb||[]).push([[250],{6908:(n,s,a)=>{a.r(s),a.d(s,{comp:()=>l,data:()=>d});var e=a(641);const i={},l=(0,a(6262).A)(i,[["render",function(n,s){return(0,e.uX)(),(0,e.CE)("div",null,s[0]||(s[0]=[(0,e.Fv)('<h1 id="日记" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#日记"><span>日记</span></a></h1><p>记录每天的工作与生活琐事，按月归档。<strong>正文是加密的</strong>：仓库和网站里只有密文，打开某个月份、输入密码后才会在你的浏览器里本地解密显示。</p><h2 id="平时怎么用-两步" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#平时怎么用-两步"><span>平时怎么用（两步）</span></a></h2><p>不想敲命令的话，项目根目录有三个 bat，<strong>双击即可</strong>：</p><table><thead><tr><th>文件</th><th>作用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>写日记.bat</code></td><td>创建今天的条目（自带骨架）并在 VS Code 打开；已有条目不会被改动</td></tr><tr><td><code>提交日记.bat</code></td><td>加密 → 提交 → 推送</td></tr><tr><td><code>新电脑初始化.bat</code></td><td>换电脑时双击一次：装依赖、输密码、解密全部日记</td></tr></tbody></table><p>对应的命令行写法：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="sh"><pre><code><span class="line"><span class="token function">npm</span> run diary          <span class="token comment"># 1. 追加今天的条目，并自动在 VS Code 打开当月文件，直接写（明文，随便改）</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token function">npm</span> run diary:push     <span class="token comment"># 2. 加密 → 提交 → 推送，一步到位</span></span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><ul><li><code>npm run diary -- 串口调试</code> 标题后带主题；<code>npm run diary -- 2026-08-01 月初计划</code> 补写指定日期；加 <code>--no-open</code> 不打开编辑器</li><li><code>npm run diary:push -- 补写上周</code> 自定义提交说明；默认是 &quot;日记 YYYY-MM-DD&quot;</li><li>改以前的日记：直接编辑 <code>private/diary/&lt;年&gt;/&lt;月&gt;.md</code>，然后同样 <code>npm run diary:push</code></li><li>排版规则：条目按日期 <strong>01 → 31</strong> 排列（越往下越新），条目之间一个空行；<code>npm run diary</code> 每次运行都会自动整理，补写的日期会插到正确位置；只想整理不新增用 <code>npm run diary -- --format</code></li><li>正文里<strong>单个换行就是换行</strong>，逐行写即可，不用像普通 Markdown 那样在行尾加两个空格或空一行</li><li>日记和其他笔记一起改时，正常 <code>git add . &amp;&amp; git commit</code> 也行：提交钩子会把有改动的月份自动加密并带上</li><li>只改了日记却用普通 <code>git commit</code>：git 会因为暂存区一开始为空而不生效，钩子会提示你再 commit 一次（这是 git 的限制，所以推荐 <code>diary:push</code>）</li></ul><h2 id="目录约定" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#目录约定"><span>目录约定</span></a></h2><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="text"><pre><code><span class="line">private/                  ← 整个目录已 gitignore，永远不要提交</span>\n<span class="line">├── .password             ← 日记密码，一行明文；钩子和 lock/unlock 脚本会自动读取</span>\n<span class="line">└── diary/2026/08.md      ← 明文，一个月一个文件，一天一个二级标题</span>\n<span class="line"></span>\n<span class="line">docs/diary/               ← 密文，提交到仓库、发布到网站</span>\n<span class="line">├── README.md             ← 本页（公开）</span>\n<span class="line">└── 2026/08.md            ← 自动生成，只含标题和密文</span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><ul><li>左侧边栏按年、月<strong>自动</strong>生成，不用改 <code>config.js</code></li><li>页面的<strong>一级标题会公开显示</strong>（当侧边栏文字用），别把隐私写在一级标题里</li></ul><h2 id="手动命令" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#手动命令"><span>手动命令</span></a></h2><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="sh"><pre><code><span class="line"><span class="token function">npm</span> run diary:lock            <span class="token comment"># 手动加密全部月份（有 private/.password 时不会再问密码）</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token function">npm</span> run diary:unlock          <span class="token comment"># 换电脑时：用密码把 docs/diary 的密文还原到 private/diary</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token function">npm</span> run diary:unlock -- <span class="token parameter variable">--force</span>   <span class="token comment"># 覆盖已存在的明文</span></span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h2 id="多台电脑" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#多台电脑"><span>多台电脑</span></a></h2><p>每台电脑各有一份明文（<code>private/</code>），通过仓库里的密文同步：</p><ul><li><strong>新电脑首次</strong>：<code>git clone</code> → <code>npm install</code> → <code>npm run diary:init</code>（输一次密码：写入密码文件、启用钩子、解密全部月份）</li><li><strong>之后每次 <code>git pull</code></strong>：钩子会自动把这次拉下来有变化的月份解密到 <code>private/diary</code>；本地缺失的月份（别的电脑新建的、或本地误删的）也会一起补齐，不用手动操作</li><li><strong>两台电脑的 <code>private/</code> 不一致没关系</strong>：仓库里的密文是唯一基准。本地多出来的月份（还没推送的草稿）pull 不会碰；本地缺的月份 pull 时补齐；仓库没新提交时钩子不会跑，这时手动 <code>npm run diary:unlock</code>（只补缺的，不碰已有的）</li><li><strong>保护规则</strong>：如果本机某个月份有还没提交的改动，pull 时不会覆盖它，而是提示你先提交（或备份后 <code>npm run diary:unlock -- --force</code>）</li><li>建议习惯：<strong>改日记前先 <code>git pull</code>，改完就提交</strong>，两台电脑同时改同一个月份就不会打架</li></ul><h2 id="关于密码与安全" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#关于密码与安全"><span>关于密码与安全</span></a></h2><ul><li>密码只存在你电脑上的 <code>private/.password</code>，不在仓库、不在网站；忘了且文件也丢了就真的解不开</li><li>密文是公开的，别人可以下载后离线猜密码。<strong>密码越短越容易被撞出来</strong>，16 位以上随机密码才算稳妥</li><li>加密方式：PBKDF2-SHA256（30 万次）派生密钥 + AES-256-GCM，实现见 <code>docs/.vuepress/diaryCrypto.js</code></li><li>解锁后密码只记在当前浏览器标签页（sessionStorage），关掉即失效；页面上&quot;锁定&quot;可立即清除</li><li>日记里如果要放图片，图片文件本身不会被加密，放到 <code>docs/.vuepress/public/</code> 并用绝对路径引用</li><li>跳过一次钩子：<code>git commit --no-verify</code>（但那样网站上的日记就不会更新）</li></ul><h2 id="写法示例" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#写法示例"><span>写法示例</span></a></h2><p><code>npm run diary</code> 新建的条目自带下面这个骨架：<strong>用 <code>###</code> 分块 → 每块列要点 → 最后一段总结</strong>。用不到的块删掉就行，块名也可以随便改。</p><div class="language-markdown line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="md"><pre><code><span class="line"><span class="token title important"><span class="token punctuation">#</span> 2026年08月日记</span></span>\n<span class="line"></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token title important"><span class="token punctuation">##</span> 08-28 星期五 串口仪器接口调试</span></span>\n<span class="line"></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token title important"><span class="token punctuation">###</span> 反思</span></span>\n<span class="line">今天遇到的坑：</span>\n<span class="line"></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token list punctuation">1.</span> 粘包问题，改为按帧头帧尾切分</span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token list punctuation">2.</span> 串口超时要设短一点</span>\n<span class="line"></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token title important"><span class="token punctuation">###</span> 项目</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token list punctuation">1.</span> 手机自动化测试工具跑通了</span>\n<span class="line"></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token title important"><span class="token punctuation">###</span> 总结</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token blockquote punctuation">&gt;</span> 明天先把 esp32 烧录器的可行性测一下</span>\n<span class="line"></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token title important"><span class="token punctuation">##</span> 08-29 星期六</span></span>\n<span class="line"></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token list punctuation">-</span> 休息</span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><ul><li>列表直接写 <code>1. </code>，前面空一行；不要整段包在 <code>&gt;</code> 里，<code>&gt;</code> 留给总结更醒目</li><li>排序脚本只认 <code>## MM-DD</code> 这一层，<code>###</code> 小标题会跟着当天一起走</li></ul>',22)]))}]]),d=JSON.parse('{"path":"/diary/","title":"日记","lang":"zh-CN","frontmatter":{},"headers":[{"level":2,"title":"平时怎么用（两步）","slug":"平时怎么用-两步","link":"#平时怎么用-两步","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"目录约定","slug":"目录约定","link":"#目录约定","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"手动命令","slug":"手动命令","link":"#手动命令","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"多台电脑","slug":"多台电脑","link":"#多台电脑","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"关于密码与安全","slug":"关于密码与安全","link":"#关于密码与安全","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"写法示例","slug":"写法示例","link":"#写法示例","children":[]}],"git":{"updatedTime":1787938063000,"contributors":[{"name":"Bo-Hong","username":"Bo-Hong","email":"2764136779@qq.com","commits":3,"url":"https://github.com/Bo-Hong"},{"name":"Claude Fable 5","username":"","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","commits":1}],"changelog":[{"hash":"877ba8439007616c3f87c8e6e4e36edf42b8f160","time":1787938063000,"email":"2764136779@qq.com","author":"Bo-Hong","message":"日记 2026-08-28"},{"hash":"f6c50316dd5b301a67929907de2162ea101f7593","time":1787937473000,"email":"2764136779@qq.com","author":"Bo-Hong","message":"日记 2026-08-28"},{"hash":"0ada666528b49742fa64c3b0283b254c02256736","time":1787933196000,"email":"2764136779@qq.com","author":"Bo-Hong","message":"新增日记功能：目录自动侧边栏 + 端到端加密 + git 钩子自动加解密","coAuthors":[{"name":"Claude Fable 5","email":"noreply@anthropic.com"}]}]},"filePathRelative":"diary/README.md"}')}}]);